{"product_id":"drop-lahde","title":"Drop Lähde","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDrop Lähde outdoor spa pool is designed and made in Finland and guarantees a first-class bathing experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe name Lähde is Finnish and refers to a spring. The name was chosen to describe this pool package and to honour Finland’s clean nature and crystal-clear springs. Clean water and atmospheric bubbles well forth from the bottom of the pool just like in a spring. Finland’s largest spring is Sulaoja spring in Lapland’s Utsjoki. The Sami people have long considered spring Sulaoja as holy, and they believe that the spring has healing properties. We hope that Drop Lähde is a place where you can relax in the middle of your busy day.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe pool technology is assembled and water-tested at the factory.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe electrically-heated Drop pools are designed for year-round use and can be kept ready to use no matter the weather. Just open up the cover and enjoy!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e  Technical details\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePeople capacity: 6–8\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide length: *220 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInner diameter: *195 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight: *105,0 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImmersion depth: *97 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight when empty: approx. 300 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaterial: acrylic \/ reinforced plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater capacity: 1830 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater use: 1,000–1,500 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElectric connection: 3 x 16 A, 400V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"teknisettiedot\" class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu129501\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e+\/- 0,5cm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eContents of the pool package\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrop spa pool in white, grey, or black\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminium frame\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 kW electrical heating (6kW in Finland, Sweden and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003e30 mm polyurethane insulation of the entire frame (50 mm in Finland, Sweden and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAerator system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED pool light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003eDigital control panel\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFilter system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003eInsulation cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUV system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOzonisation system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003eStarter kit of pool chemicals\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"sisalto\" class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu129511\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Drop","offers":[{"title":"Black \/ Temperate \/ No","offer_id":44553776464196,"sku":"301140508","price":14300.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \/ Temperate \/ Connection only","offer_id":47718641860932,"sku":"","price":14850.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \/ Temperate \/ Connection + Drop Stove","offer_id":47718641893700,"sku":"","price":16850.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \/ Cold \/ No","offer_id":47717119525188,"sku":"301140509","price":14300.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \/ Cold \/ Connection only","offer_id":47718641926468,"s